# This file is part of ShareR™
# .gitignore: Excludes local tools, credentials, caches, and temporary development files.
# Author(s): Gabriel Mongefranco.
# Created: 2026-07-27
# Last Modified: 2026-09-04
# Summary: Prevents local-only and sensitive files from entering version control while keeping
